---
// src/components/PlatformModules.astro
---

<section class="py-24 relative bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-slate-200/80">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-28">
    
    <!-- MODULE 1: SMART DD CHECKLIST (Section 15) -->
    <div id="checklist" class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-5">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-violet-50 border border-violet-200 text-violet-700 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">
          Module 01 // Scope Engineering
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading tracking-tight">
          Start with the right questions.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          Every diligence starts with scope. LIFT helps teams create structured, reusable and transaction-specific DD checklists so that the right information is requested from the beginning.
        </p>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-2">
          {['Custom checklists', 'Reusable templates', 'Workstream-based requests', 'Priority tagging', 'Owner assignment', 'Due dates & SLAs', 'Status tracking', 'Document linking'].map((feat) => (
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-700 font-medium">
              <span class="text-violet-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>{feat}</span>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4">
          <a href="/contact?intent=demo" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-violet-700 hover:text-violet-800 transition-colors">
            <span>Explore Smart Checklists</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Checklist UI Mockup -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-md">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-slate-100 text-xs">
          <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Series A SaaS Checklist // Standard Scope</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-emerald-200 font-medium">Active Scoping</span>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-4 space-y-2.5">
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-bold">✓</span>
              <span class="text-slate-900 font-medium">FY23–FY25 Audited Financial Statements</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500">Finance // Assigned</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-bold">✓</span>
              <span class="text-slate-900 font-medium">Fully Diluted Cap Table & ESOP Scheme</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500">Corporate // Assigned</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-bold">⋯</span>
              <span class="text-slate-900 font-medium">Customer Master Agreements (Top 10)</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-amber-700 font-medium">Commercial // Due in 2d</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded bg-slate-200 text-slate-500 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-bold">○</span>
              <span class="text-slate-900 font-medium">IP Assignment & Patent Deeds</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400">Legal // Pending Upload</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODULE 2: SMART DATA ROOM (Section 16) -->
    <div id="dataroom" class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
      <!-- Data Room Mockup -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 order-2 lg:order-1 bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-md">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-slate-100 text-xs">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Deal Vault // TechFlow Robotics</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-blue-700 bg-blue-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-blue-200 font-medium">Role: Investment Committee (Watermarked)</span>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-xs">
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-blue-600">📁</span>
              <div>
                <div class="text-slate-900 font-medium">01_Financial_Diligence/</div>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">Mapped to: Parameter 1.1–1.8 • 18 Documents</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-emerald-700 font-medium">4 Verified</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-purple-600">📁</span>
              <div>
                <div class="text-slate-900 font-medium">02_Corporate_Secretarial/</div>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">Mapped to: Parameter 2.1–2.4 • 24 Documents</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-emerald-700 font-medium">All Reconciled</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-amber-600">📁</span>
              <div>
                <div class="text-slate-900 font-medium">03_Material_Contracts/</div>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">Mapped to: Parameter 3.1–3.6 • 42 Documents</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-amber-700 font-medium">2 Under Review</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-500">
          <span>Granular access by workstream</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 font-mono font-medium">Immutable audit logging</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-6 order-1 lg:order-2 space-y-5">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 text-blue-700 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">
          Module 02 // Document Infrastructure
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading tracking-tight">
          A data room built around the diligence.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          A data room should do more than store files. LIFT connects documents directly with the DD requirements, experts, queries and findings they support.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-1">
          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
            <div class="text-slate-900 font-semibold text-xs mb-1">Structured Folders</div>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Pre-organised strictly by DD workstream, eliminating folder sprawl.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
            <div class="text-slate-900 font-semibold text-xs mb-1">Document Mapping</div>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Connect files directly to specific diligence checklist requirements.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
            <div class="text-slate-900 font-semibold text-xs mb-1">Granular Permissions</div>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Control file visibility strictly by professional role and workstream.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
            <div class="text-slate-900 font-semibold text-xs mb-1">Activity Tracking</div>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Complete visibility over document access, downloads, and annotations.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2">
          <a href="/contact?intent=demo" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-800 transition-colors">
            <span>Explore Data Room</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODULE 3: EXPERT NETWORK & WORKSPACE (Sections 17 & 18) -->
    <div id="experts" class="space-y-12">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 text-purple-700 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">
          Module 03 // Professional Ecosystem
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading tracking-tight mt-3">
          The right expertise for every question.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mt-3">
          No single professional sees the entire business. LIFT enables a coordinated diligence environment where specialists can work together across multiple dimensions of a transaction.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 8 Expert Categories Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        {[
          { title: 'Chartered Accountant', scope: 'Financial controls, P&L, balance sheet, and tax review.' },
          { title: 'Company Secretary', scope: 'Corporate governance, ROC, and secretarial compliance.' },
          { title: 'Legal Expert', scope: 'Material contracts, litigation risk, and regulatory mandates.' },
          { title: 'IP Lawyer', scope: 'Patents, trademarks, copyright, and technology licensing.' },
          { title: 'CFA / Investment Lead', scope: 'Financial modeling, working capital, and unit economics.' },
          { title: 'Registered Valuer', scope: 'Business valuation, securities, and asset benchmarking.' },
          { title: 'Technology Expert', scope: 'Architecture, codebase health, IT, and cybersecurity.' },
          { title: 'Domain Specialist', scope: 'Industry-specific operating benchmarks and risk parameters.' }
        ].map((item) => (
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs hover:border-purple-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading">{item.title}</div>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-1.5 leading-relaxed">{item.scope}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <!-- Expert Workspace Mockup -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-md">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between pb-4 border-b border-slate-100 gap-2">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-purple-700 uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">Dedicated Expert Workspace Terminal</span>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mt-0.5">Assigned Specialist: Financial & Tax Lead</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs">
            <span class="text-slate-500">Target: TechFlow Robotics</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 text-purple-700 font-mono text-[10px] font-medium">Active Engagement</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-7 gap-3 mt-4 text-center">
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 block uppercase font-medium">Workstreams</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 font-mono">Financial + Tax</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 block uppercase font-medium">Documents</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-bold text-violet-700 font-mono">38 Allocated</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 block uppercase font-medium">Open Queries</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-bold text-amber-600 font-mono">06 Pending</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 block uppercase font-medium">Pending Actions</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 font-mono">02 Reviews</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 block uppercase font-medium">Findings</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-bold text-rose-600 font-mono">03 Flagged</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 block uppercase font-medium">Deadline</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 font-mono">In 3 Days</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200">
            <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-700 block uppercase font-semibold">Status</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-800 font-mono">On Schedule</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 text-center text-xs text-slate-500">
          <span class="text-slate-900 font-medium">One transaction. Multiple experts. One coordinated workspace.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODULE 4: AI DOCUMENT INTELLIGENCE (Section 19) -->
    <div id="ai-intel" class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-5">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-cyan-50 border border-cyan-200 text-cyan-700 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">
          Module 04 // Cognitive Assistance
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading tracking-tight">
          Let the documents speak faster.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          LIFT can use technology-assisted document intelligence to help teams process large volumes of information more efficiently.
        </p>

        <!-- Positioning Callout -->
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-cyan-50/70 border border-cyan-200">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-cyan-800 uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">Foundational Principle:</div>
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mt-1">AI-assisted. Expert-verified.</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
            AI augments discovery, flags variances, and summarizes large schedules—but professional judgment remains firmly in the hands of qualified advisory specialists.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs">
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
            <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900 block">CLASSIFY</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Identify and categorize document types</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
            <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900 block">EXTRACT</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Surface key clauses, numbers and covenants</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
            <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900 block">SUMMARISE</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Produce concise multi-page summaries</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
            <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900 block">COMPARE</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Detect differences between versions</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
            <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900 block">FLAG</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Surface inconsistencies and review triggers</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
            <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900 block">ASK</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Natural queries against authorized files</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- AI Intel Mockup -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-md space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-slate-100 text-xs">
          <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900 font-mono">Ask LIFT // Intelligence Query</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-cyan-700 bg-cyan-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-cyan-200 font-mono font-medium">Scope: Authorized Contracts</span>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-xs text-slate-700">
          <span class="text-cyan-700 font-semibold">User Prompt:</span> "Does any vendor contract include change-of-control termination triggers or uncapped liability?"
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-cyan-50/50 border border-cyan-200 space-y-2.5 text-xs">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px]">
            <span class="text-cyan-800 font-semibold">LIFT Synthesis (Verified against 42 Documents)</span>
            <span class="text-slate-500 font-mono font-medium">Confidence: High</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-700 text-xs leading-relaxed">
            Identified 1 change-of-control provision in <span class="text-slate-900 font-medium">Enterprise Supply Agreement §14.2 (LogiCore Solutions)</span> requiring 30 days prior written notice before equity acquisition closing.
          </p>
          <div class="pt-2 border-t border-cyan-200 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px]">
            <span class="text-slate-500 font-mono">Source: DOC-LEGAL-084.pdf (p. 23)</span>
            <span class="text-violet-700 font-semibold">Auto-Mapped to Query Hub &rarr;</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODULE 5: QUERY HUB (Section 20) -->
    <div id="queryhub" class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
      <!-- Query Hub Lifecycle Mockup -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 order-2 lg:order-1 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-md space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-slate-100 text-xs">
          <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Central Query Hub // Live Stream</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-emerald-200 font-mono font-medium">5-Stage State Machine</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Query Lifecycle Strip -->
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono text-center px-1">
          <span class="text-slate-500 font-semibold">RAISED &rarr;</span>
          <span class="text-slate-500 font-semibold">ASSIGNED &rarr;</span>
          <span class="text-slate-500 font-semibold">RESPONDED &rarr;</span>
          <span class="text-slate-500 font-semibold">REVIEWED &rarr;</span>
          <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold">RESOLVED</span>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-2.5">
          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Query #Q-FIN-019: FY24 R&D Capitalization</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 font-mono text-[10px] font-medium">Resolved</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">
              "Please clarify software development cost capitalization policy under Ind AS 38."
            </p>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] text-slate-500 pt-1 border-t border-slate-200 font-mono">
              <span>Expert: Chartered Accountant</span>
              <span>Evidence Attached: Schedule 14A</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Query #Q-CORP-007: MCA Form PAS-3 Confirmation</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-mono text-[10px] font-medium">Responded / Reviewing</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">
              "Stamp duty receipt confirmation for preferential allotment dated 12/04/2024."
            </p>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] text-slate-500 pt-1 border-t border-slate-200 font-mono">
              <span>Expert: Company Secretary</span>
              <span>Founder Response: 4 hrs ago</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-6 order-1 lg:order-2 space-y-5">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 text-emerald-700 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">
          Module 05 // Q&A Architecture
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading tracking-tight">
          Every question. One place.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          Due diligence is as much about asking the right questions as reviewing the right documents. LIFT brings questions, responses, documents and experts into one structured conversation.
        </p>

        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          Each query is bound to a specific DD parameter, supporting file, specialist owner, SLA, and complete audit history.
        </p>

        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 font-medium text-xs text-emerald-800">
          No important question should disappear into an email thread.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODULE 6: RISK & FINDINGS (Section 21) -->
    <div id="findings" class="space-y-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-rose-50 border border-rose-200 text-rose-700 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">
          Module 06 // Decision Intelligence
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading tracking-tight mt-3">
          See what matters.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mt-3">
          Findings become valuable when they are structured, prioritised and connected to evidence. LIFT categorizes observations with institutional severity parameters.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Severity Taxonomy & Finding Cards -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-rose-50/70 border border-rose-200 space-y-3 shadow-xs">
