          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-200 space-y-3 shadow-xs">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono text-amber-700 uppercase">HIGH RISK</span>
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900">Requires immediate attention</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Remediation condition precedent (CP) or condition subsequent (CS) required before closing.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-blue-50/70 border border-blue-200 space-y-3 shadow-xs">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
