          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 space-y-3 shadow-xs">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono text-slate-700 uppercase">LOW RISK</span>
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-slate-400"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900">Minor observation</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
